    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah that makes sense. u mentioned moral decline and people wanting that return to truth. i feel like a lot of people are saying the \"truth\" is basically just that the current systems are completely corrupt and rigged against regular people. do u think that's actually the case, or is that just more of the rhetoric?",
